            Why do government portals enforce a tight 50KB limit on PDFs?
          </h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.925rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.65;">
            Agencies like SSC, UPPSC, and BPSC receive between 10 lakh and 50 lakh applications per recruitment cycle. Imposing a 50KB limit keeps database backups lightweight, minimizes server storage costs, prevents bandwidth choking during last-minute deadline rushes, and ensures application pages load smoothly over 2G/3G mobile networks in rural areas.
          </p>
