            Will my document roll number and certificate serial number remain legible at 50KB?
          </h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.925rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.65;">
            Yes, provided the source document is a single page and scanned with good contrast at 150 DPI in grayscale. Our tool dynamically calculates the exact balance between JPEG quantization and canvas dimensions, preserving text lines and numbers so they pass manual officer verification and automated OCR validation.
          </p>
        </div>

