          </h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.925rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.65;">
            While technically possible, we strongly discourage squeezing 3 or more pages into 50KB. Squeezing 4 pages gives barely 10KB per page, which leads to heavy pixelation and unreadable fine print. For multi-page transcripts, use our <a href="/separate-pdf-pages" style="color: var(--color-lime); text-decoration: underline;">Separate PDF Pages</a> tool to submit only the final consolidated certificate or marksheet required by the portal.
          </p>
