            Why did the portal reject my PDF even though the file is under 50KB?
          </h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.925rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.65;">
            Common reasons for rejection include: (1) The portal enforces a <em>minimum</em> file size (e.g., 20KB min to 50KB max) and an over-compressed file fell below 20KB; (2) The file name contains spaces or special characters (rename to <code>certificate_50kb.pdf</code>); (3) The PDF was password-protected; or (4) The portal required a JPG rather than a PDF. Always verify the portal's exact file type and naming specifications.
